WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.949
During the pandemic, a molecular receptor and ordinary

00:00:04.949 --> 00:00:08.324
hypertension prescriptions became entangled in clinical

00:00:08.324 --> 00:00:08.886
speculation.

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:19.095
During COVID-19, clinicians were treating infection in

00:00:19.095 --> 00:00:23.261
patients who also lived with hypertension and chronic

00:00:23.261 --> 00:00:24.303
medication exposure.

00:00:30.450 --> 00:00:35.000
Soluble ACE2 and angiotensin II are distinct

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:38.900
measurements in the renin-angiotensin system. Their

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:41.500
interpretation requires clinical context.

00:00:45.450 --> 00:00:50.013
Our 2022 publication investigated reported differences

00:00:50.013 --> 00:00:55.336
in those levels among hypertensive COVID-19 patients

00:00:55.336 --> 00:00:58.377
receiving different antihypertensive medications.

00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:03.337
Medication groups, disease severity and confounding

00:01:03.337 --> 00:01:07.667
factors matter. A measured level does not reveal the

00:01:07.667 --> 00:01:09.111
entire causal pathway.

00:01:15.450 --> 00:01:19.515
Soluble ACE2 and angiotensin II are biological

00:01:19.515 --> 00:01:23.579
measurements. Group differences alone cannot prove that

00:01:23.579 --> 00:01:27.063
an antihypertensive caused a clinical outcome.

00:01:31.450 --> 00:01:35.285
A signal in a patient cohort motivates mechanistic

00:01:35.285 --> 00:01:38.641
investigation. It should not become an unsupported

00:01:38.641 --> 00:01:41.517
instruction to stop or change medication.

00:01:46.450 --> 00:01:49.507
Here the disciplined question concerns association

00:01:49.507 --> 00:01:54.092
under specified treatment groups, not advice to stop or

00:01:54.092 --> 00:01:55.111
start medication.
